---
description: Respect app architecture boundaries and import direction.
globs:
  - "src/**/*.{ts,tsx,css}"
alwaysApply: true
---

- Keep route modules in `app/` thin; compose UI from `components/` and business/data from `hooks/` and `services/`.
- Do not move business logic into styling-only changes.
- Keep dependency direction stable:
  - `app/` can import from `components`, `hooks`, `services`, `context`, `lib`, `types`.
  - `components/features/*` can import from `components/ui`, `components/common`, `hooks`, `services`, `lib`, `types`.
  - `services/` must not import React/UI modules.
- Do not rename public exports, route paths, or runtime import file paths for styling tasks.
